## Agents
The plugin provides three subagents (`planner`, `researcher`, `reviewer`) for
specialised work. See `AGENTS.md` for when to use each and their prompt definitions
(symlinked at `.cursor/agents/` after bootstrap).

## Hooks
Three guardrails (`dep-age-guard`, `format-changed`, `run-tests`) run automatically from
the **installed plugin** — not from this repo. See `HOOKS.md` for when each fires and
what it does. Script sources and wiring are symlinked under `.cursor/hooks/` for
reference only.

## MCP
The plugin ships a GitHub MCP server config (`github`). It loads from the **installed
plugin**, not this repo. See `MCP.md` for servers, required env vars, and the reference
symlink at `.cursor/agentic-workflow-mcp.json`.

## Not in this plugin
Cursor skills (`~/.cursor/skills-cursor/`) are a separate system — not symlinked or
referenced here. This workflow uses plugin **commands**, **agents**, **hooks**, and **MCP**
only.

